# Cycle of Renewal: "Sacrifice a land. Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped,
# then shuffle." (CR 701.21a, 701.23, 701.24). Bot1 has a Forest and an Island and pays with the three Moxen: it chooses the Island
# to sacrifice (the Mox Emerald is no land and the Forest is the other one), then finds two basic lands, which arrive tapped.
# A third basic land, a nonbasic land and a creature are not allowed, and Bot2's library, with basic lands of its own, is untouched.

